  "title": "Solésence Beauty Science and other Chicago Innovation Awards Winners to Ring the Nasdaq Opening Bell",
  "summary": "Romeoville, Ill., July 8, 2024 – Solésence Beauty Science, a leader in inclusive, mineral-based beauty products for skincare and makeup brands and a wholly owned subsidiary of Nanophase Technologies Corporation, will join fellow winners of the Chicago Innovation Awards, the Chicago region’s foremost annual celebration of innovation, in New York City on Tuesday, July 9th…",
